        "TileImage": "$($repository c0ab162c-1502-40d5-801f-c5471289d6b7).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. The former race director of the Miami Global Innovation Race wants you to eliminate Sierra Knox and Moses Lee. Apparently, last year&apos;s controversial finish drew the ire of both Kronstadt and Kowoon, resulting in the organizers&apos; decision to fire him. Now he wants revenge. Eliminate both drivers by any means necessary, as our client believes that their rivalry should end in a draw that will never be settled.\r\rI shall now leave you to prepare.",
